.TH  cxine  1 "2020/05/21"

.SH SYNOPSIS

.PP
pssec is a simple tool that displays some security features (or issues) active on running processes
.SH USAGE

.nf
.ft CW
.RS
.EX

  pssec [OPTIONS]
.RE
.EE
.fi
.in
.ad b
.nop  
.SH OPTIONS

.PP
.in +2

.TP
.B -f <num>
set maximum number of file descriptors above which we raise a 'fdleak' warning (default 200)

.TP
.B -max-fd <num>
set maximum number of file descriptors above which we raise a 'fdleak' warning (default 200)

.TP
.B --max-fd <num>
set maximum number of file descriptors above which we raise a \(aqfdleak\(aq warning (default 200)

.TP
.B -key
display list of security values

.TP
.B --key
display list of security values

.TP
.B --version
display program version

.TP
.B -version
display program version

.TP
.B --help
display this help

.TP
.B -help
display this help

.TP
.B -?
display this help
.in

